--------+---------------+------------------------------------------+----------------+--------------+----------------+----------------+-----------+--------+-------------------------------------------------------------
      1 | 461000001     | C01 Born after window end                | 2023-01-01     | 2023-12-31   | 2024-11-01     |                | error     | skip   | {birth_date_raw,valid_to_raw}
